.el .ds Aq '
.TH pcx-snapshot 1  "pcx 0.1.3"
.SH NAME
pcx\-snapshot \- Write a projected ROS 2 PointCloud2 Point Frame as an RGBA8 PNG
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpcx snapshot\fR <\fB\-\-topic\fR> [\fB\-\-frame\fR] [\fB\-\-at\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-height\fR] [\fB\-\-memory\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT.mcap\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a projected ROS 2 PointCloud2 Point Frame as an RGBA8 PNG
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<TOPIC>\fR
Topic whose messages are counted as Point Frames
.TP
\fB\-\-frame\fR \fI<INDEX>\fR
Zero\-based Point Frame index after Topic selection
.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
First Point Frame at or after this duration from recording start
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<PATH|\->\fR
Output PNG path, or \*(Aq\-\*(Aq for binary\-safe stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing output file
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<PIXELS>\fR [default: 80]
Projection raster width in pixels
.TP
\fB\-\-height\fR \fI<PIXELS>\fR [default: 48]
Projection raster height in pixels
.TP
\fB\-\-memory\-limit\fR \fI<BYTES>\fR [default: 536870912]
Hard managed\-memory limit in bytes
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT.mcap\fR>
MCAP Source containing the Point Frame
